CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F342A1785323907
OL,3,CCase of missing Nuneaton woman now
OL,4,Ctreated as suspected murder, police
OL,5,Cconfirm
OL,7,FDetectives investigating the
OL,8,Fdisappearance of a 48-year-old woman
OL,9,Ffrom Nuneaton six months ago are now
OL,10,Ftreating the case as a suspected
OL,11,Fmurder.
OL,13,FKatie Love was last seen alive at the
OL,14,Fend of January this year and was
OL,15,Freported missing a month later.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G1/6
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,343,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34202
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F342A1785323907
OL,3,CCase of missing Nuneaton woman now
OL,4,Ctreated as suspected murder, police
OL,5,Cconfirm
OL,7,FDespite major efforts to find her, the
OL,8,F48-year-old remains missing and
OL,9,Fleading officers say while they 'truly
OL,10,Fhope' she is found safe and well, they
OL,11,Fare now treating her disappearance as
OL,12,F'suspected murder'.
OL,14,FIn statement senior investigating
OL,15,Fofficer, Detective Inspector Gareth
OL,16,FUnett from Warwickshire Police said
OL,17,Fthey are desperate to get closure for
OL,18,Fher heartbroken family.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G2/6
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,343,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F342A1785323907
OL,3,CCase of missing Nuneaton woman now
OL,4,Ctreated as suspected murder, police
OL,5,Cconfirm
OL,7,F"We know Katie was last seen alive at
OL,8,Fthe end of January and - despite
OL,9,Fsignificant investigative work - sadly
OL,10,Fwe have no confirmed proof of life
OL,11,Fbeyond that point", DI Unett said.
OL,13,F"We remain open-minded and truly hope
OL,14,Fshe's found alive and well, however,
OL,15,Fbased on the information we've
OL,16,Fgathered, we strongly believe she may
OL,17,Fhave come to harm and are now treating
OL,18,Fher disappearance as suspected murder.
OL,26,@uD@AOU
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G3/6
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,343,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F342A1785323907
OL,3,CCase of missing Nuneaton woman now
OL,4,Ctreated as suspected murder, police
OL,5,Cconfirm
OL,7,F"As we continue to try to find her, we
OL,8,Fremain in close contact with Katie's
OL,9,Ffamily and friends, providing updates
OL,10,Fand support. Given the length of time
OL,11,Fthat has passed, it's important to get
OL,12,Fclosure for them.
OL,14,F"If you have information about Katie's
OL,15,Fdisappearance or know where she may
OL,16,Fbe, please tell us. Any information,
OL,17,Fno matter how small, could prove
OL,18,Fcrucial to our investigation.
OL,26,@oD@AOUvD@AOU
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G4/6
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,343,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34205
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F342A1785323907
OL,3,CCase of missing Nuneaton woman now
OL,4,Ctreated as suspected murder, police
OL,5,Cconfirm
OL,7,F"Please share the appeal to help us
OL,8,Ffind Katie so we can get answers for
OL,9,Fher loved ones."
OL,11,FKatie, who has links to Hartshill and
OL,12,FKingsbury as well as Skegness, was
OL,13,Flast seen by her family on January 23
OL,14,Fand was reported missing on Monday,
OL,15,FFebruary 23.
OL,17,FSince the alarm was raised with police
OL,18,Fthe hunt for Katie has seen searches
OL,19,Fin the Abbey Green area of the town,
OL,20,Fincluding in drains, as part of
OL,21,Fefforts to find crucial evidence.
OL,26,@oD@AOU
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G5/6
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,343,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34206
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F342A1785323907
OL,3,CCase of missing Nuneaton woman now
OL,4,Ctreated as suspected murder, police
OL,5,Cconfirm
OL,7,FOfficers have also looked through
OL,8,FCCTV, and spoke with Katie's friends
OL,9,Fand family.
OL,11,FTwo men - a 48-year-old and a 49-year-
OL,12,Fold from Nuneaton ` were arrested on
OL,13,Fsuspicion of murder, but bailed while
OL,14,Fa second 49-year-old man from Nuneaton
OL,15,Fwas released under investigation (RUI)
OL,16,Fin connection with Katie's
OL,17,Fdisappearance.
OL,19,FOfficers have urged anyone who has any
OL,20,Finformation about Katie to get in
OL,21,Ftouch.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G6/6
